  "id": "spiced-roast-chicken",
  "name": "Spiced Roast Chicken",
  "subtitle": "Oregano, basil, and cayenne season a crisp-skinned roast chicken.",
  "description": "Coat a whole chicken with oil and a savory spice blend, then roast it in two temperature stages until fully cooked and juicy.",
